    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29446" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlesto</span></b> , 1, v. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to trouble, annoy, molest</i>: aliquem, Petr. Fragm. ap.
