					34, 3, 20</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">uva raro valde molestat,</span>”
				<i>is troublesome</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Larg. 71</span></i>
			.</div>
